usband and me, and our three precious offspring, to drive to North Carolina from California for our next visit, instead of flying. Why? Well, because of the Gestapo TSA. But actually, even before I read your column, I was convinced. I&#39;ve seen the TSA in action; it&#39;s not a pretty sight. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thanks for reminding us! And yes, as a mom, I&#39;m much more afraid of our government than I am of any supposed terrorists.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116551290961014906/comments/default/116555689490996999'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116551290961014906/comments/default/116555689490996999'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/12/brief-notes-on-criminal-racket-called.html?showComment=1165556880000#c116555689490996999' title=''/><author><name>Trish, Comic Mom</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13433689289015988744</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/12/brief-notes-on-criminal-racket-called.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116551290961014906' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116551290961014906' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-992776254"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 7, 2006 at 10:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116555169718797097</id><published>2006-12-07T21:21:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-12-07T21:21:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>As a TSA officer, I, too, am disturbed.....OK?! th...</title><content type='html'>As a TSA officer, I, too, am disturbed.....OK?! that so many of you people are concurned of our actions, today. We cant, at the TSA, cannot do our job if I constantly have to look over my shoulder. Now, Do you want to be safe? Okay then! Be quit and let us do our thing. How for you say that in times of troubles with islamo-fasistic terrorism that we cannot do it right, according to the didictums from Homeland Security? Our job is so crucile to sound national security and liberty and rights and all else. So, now with everthing said and laid bare, do you all still want protection? Okay! Now to step aside and let TSA agents do what we can do for you, and are paid to do to you in order that security is maintained! Like an old saying goes: &quot;With friends like these who needs enemays?&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116551290961014906/comments/default/116555169718797097'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116551290961014906/comments/default/116555169718797097'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/12/brief-notes-on-criminal-racket-called.html?showComment=1165551660000#c116555169718797097' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/12/brief-notes-on-criminal-racket-called.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116551290961014906' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116551290961014906' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 7, 2006 at 9:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116554495950146822</id><published>2006-12-07T19:29:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2006-12-07T19:29:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Notice how this guy and every other Damn Governmen...</title><content type='html'>Notice how this guy and every other Damn Government Agent uses the excuse, &quot;well you don&#39;t want another 9/11 do you?&quot;   I have wondered how the globalists would destroy America and I have found the answer.   I believe the 9/11 Truth Movement showing evidence that the US Gov somehow brought about 9/11.   Now they can set up a police state (to protect us of course!!).   And they can condemn any of us that oppose these police state measures as terrorists and put us away....all the while the sheeple of this nation are looking on and approving this evil scheme.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116551290961014906/comments/default/116554495950146822'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116551290961014906/comments/default/116554495950146822'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/12/brief-notes-on-criminal-racket-called.html?showComment=1165544940000#c116554495950146822' title=''/><author><name>arne</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05971811866752566814</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/12/brief-notes-on-criminal-racket-called.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116551290961014906' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116551290961014906' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1898690585"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTi